{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46172","headline":"秋夜怀嵩少因寄洛中旧知 · 贯休","name":"秋夜怀嵩少因寄洛中旧知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鑪爇旃檀不称贫，霏霏玉露湿禅巾。\n紫金地上三更月，红藕香中一病身。\n少室少年偏入梦，多时多事去无因。\n如今憔悴头成雪，空想嵯峨羡故人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}